      "text": {
        "jp": "おおっ！？　投げると強かったのか！",
        "official_en": "What!? You mean all this time I could’ve done <text style=\"italic\">THAT</>!? Why didn’t anybody tell me!?",
        "real_en": "What?! It's stronger when I <text style=\"italic\">throw</> it?!"
