      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お前たちの強さは、そんなものか？\r\nオレを追いつめてみせろ！",
        "official_en": "Is that all you can muster? Give me more! Put me on the ropes! Get me all tangled up in them, even!",
        "real_en": "Is that as strong as you are? Come on, push me to my limit!"
      },
