      "text": {
        "jp": "さあ！　決着をつけようぜ！\r\nオレが世界を滅ぼしてやる！　守ってみせろ！",
        "official_en": "I shall destroy your world if you do not defeat me, so come and defend it!",
        "real_en": "Come on! Let's settle this! I'll destroy your world! Show me you can protect it!"
